out/

# Local-only build/process artifacts that don't belong in a public repo:
#   - swa-docs/secrets-manager-saas-api*.yaml is CyberArk's public API
#     reference (downloaded from api-docs.cyberark.com) -- referenceable,
#     not redistributable.
#   - PDFs (brand guidelines, datasheets, etc.) are excluded as a class.
swa-docs/secrets-manager-saas-api*.yaml
*.pdf
